  m_Name: SO_4_1_Thought_ElizabethChair
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GlassTextScriptableObject
  baseText: The housemaid, Elizabeth, would sit in this chair to read the book while
    Arthur and I sat at her feet.
  fragAText: 
  fragBText: She knew Father would deem the books unfit for children of the Montbury
    family, so she hid them right above the main doors.
  bothText: 
